@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki.provisioning.license.integration"

Feature: Koroneiki To Provisioning License API Okta Authentication
	Testing Okta Authentication permission for users

Scenario: View license with okta Authentication using a valid user 
	Testing the ability to view licenses  a license form options with the okta ID Session

	When I log into the dev domain as "koconnell@xtivia.com.broken" with password "test"
	And I obtain the okta session ID value from the dev domain page
	And I search for the licenses keys on the account "Xtivia - SP" with the name "Test1" using okta authentication
	Then I should be able to view using okta authenticantion the following generate license form options for the account "Xtivia - SP" with the product group "DXP"
	| Label | 7.0 |
	| Label | 7.1 |
	| Label | 7.2 |
	| Label | 7.3 |
	| Label | 7.4 |	

