Scenario: View license with okta Authentication attempt using a non permissioned user 
	Testing the ability to not view a license form options  with the okta ID Session

	When I log into the dev domain as "mohamed.othman@liferay.com.broken" with password "test"
	And I obtain the okta session ID value from the dev domain page
	And I attempt to search for the licenses keys on the account "Xtivia - SP" with the name "Test1" using a non permissioned user with okta authentication
	

